# ============================================================
# HiddenResource_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   DiscoverySystem.IsTypeDiscovered check and EventBus.Raise
#   stay in C#. VS reads IsDiscovered and calls Discover/ForceDiscover.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [On Custom Event "OnProbeScanComplete"]
#     → [GetComponent<HiddenResource>]
#     → [InvokeMember: Discover]
#   [Update] → [GetComponent<HiddenResource>]
#     → [GetMember: IsDiscovered]
#     → [Branch: IsDiscovered AND NOT prevDiscovered]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnResourceRevealed"]
#   [Set Variable: prevDiscovered = IsDiscovered]
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   "OnResourceRevealed" → play discovery ping VFX, update minimap
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on GatherableSupply prefab root alongside HiddenResource
# ============================================================